WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.281 --> 00:00:01.391
- I'm very hungry.

00:00:01.391 --> 00:00:02.685
(laughs)

00:00:02.685 --> 00:00:04.388
I saved myself for this.

00:00:04.388 --> 00:00:06.971
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:13.982
Today, we're gonna try...

00:00:13.982 --> 00:00:16.495
- [Together] Kit-Kat Cookie Dough!

00:00:16.495 --> 00:00:17.726
- I'm really picky about chocolates,

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:19.392
I don't like any, just
like normal chocolate.

00:00:19.392 --> 00:00:21.884
- Oh, you gotta have shit in them.

00:00:21.884 --> 00:00:24.531
- Kit-Kat and cookie
dough, I mean I don't know

00:00:24.531 --> 00:00:26.095
how that's gonna taste but I'm excited.

00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:27.362
- ...having a crappy day, and you're like,

00:00:27.362 --> 00:00:29.898
"I just really want some
chocolate, to just amp me up."

00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:31.786
- I over-saturate myself with chocolate.

00:00:31.786 --> 00:00:32.619
- Like you over chocolate.

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:34.313
- I'm ready to try this
Kit-Kat Cookie Dough.

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:35.480
- Let's do it.

00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:39.531
Oh I caught it!
- Yeah!

00:00:39.531 --> 00:00:40.864
- Gimme a break.

00:00:42.526 --> 00:00:43.429
- Cheers.

00:00:43.429 --> 00:00:45.279
- I really don't think
this can go that wrong.

00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:47.052
- It may also be good
if it's cookie dough.

00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:48.523
- Looks like a sports bar.

00:00:48.523 --> 00:00:49.356
- It does.

00:00:49.356 --> 00:00:51.775
Get in the gym, get chunky!

00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:53.343
♫ Gimme a piece of that Kit-Kat

00:00:53.343 --> 00:00:55.533
♫ Is it chunky, is it fresh

00:00:55.533 --> 00:00:58.676
- Oh, you can break off a
piece and share with your pals.

00:00:58.676 --> 00:01:00.281
- I don't understand what I'm eating.

00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:03.239
- I mean, I keep biting it,
so clearly it tastes good.

00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:06.742
- I taste the extra
sugar, that's for sure.

00:01:06.742 --> 00:01:09.074
- If you want a full on
dessert, this is better

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:10.195
than a regular Kit-Kat.

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:12.495
- This is like what you've
given up a little bit on life,

00:01:12.495 --> 00:01:14.391
like you're like, "Girl, fuck that diet."

00:01:14.391 --> 00:01:16.470
- Or flipping, your boyfriend
just broke up with you,

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:19.680
after you found out he cheated on you.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.301
I'll eat the whole shit, gimme two!

00:01:22.301 --> 00:01:25.638
- If I want cookie dough, I
would just eat cookie dough.

00:01:25.638 --> 00:01:27.975
- They're just trying to
bring flavors together--

00:01:27.975 --> 00:01:29.440
- I know.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.690
- (mumbles and laughs)

00:01:36.277 --> 00:01:37.947
- It's great, it's a
great dessert, I like it,

00:01:37.947 --> 00:01:38.780
thumbs up!

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.817
- Maybe if there was more
cookie dough I would taste it.

00:01:40.817 --> 00:01:43.155
- I feel like you expect
too much from candy bars.

00:01:43.155 --> 00:01:44.238
- Maybe I do.

